<div class="mlw">

  <!-- VIDEO + INTRO -->
  <div class="block-section">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>EduMEasy: A Comprehensive Math-Lab for Schools</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="vi-grid">
      <!-- YouTube Video -->
      <div class="vi-main">
        <div class="vi-video-wrap">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/c5y9BX_tTfk?controls=1&rel=0&playsinline=1&modestbranding=1"
            title="Math Lab | EduMEasy | Introduction Math Lab"
            allowfullscreen
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture">
          </iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="vi-video-label">Math Lab Introduction — Watch Now</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Intro Text -->
      <div class="vi-text">
        <h3>Making Math Engaging, Interactive &amp; Real</h3>
        <p><a href="https://edumeasy.com/">EduMEasy</a> has developed a comprehensive <a href="https://edumeasy.com/activity/">Math-Lab for Schools</a> to visualize and understand mathematical concepts through experiments. Our aim is to provide a one-stop solution for students to understand &amp; apply math concepts in real time — combining theory, applications, and experiments.</p>
        <p>EduMEasy Math Lab for Schools has a delightful workshop for every student who faces difficulty in Math. It adds surplus to the studies and will have a remarkable impact on the learning experience — helping to visualize every concept of mathematics and making learning easy.</p>
        <p>Visualization and experimentation are two important aspects of teaching mathematics. There is a saying:</p>
        <div class="quote-box">
          <p>— A picture is worth 1000 words, if one is aware of its scope.</p>
          <p>— A picture is worth 1000 words, if one is able to use it flexibly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="num">50%</div>
        <div class="lbl">Students afraid of maths</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="num">100%</div>
        <div class="lbl">NCERT syllabus covered</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="num">IIT</div>
        <div class="lbl">Jodhpur faculty &amp; alumni</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Math Lab Concept -->
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>Math Lab Concept</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-box">
      <p>Researchers observed that understanding patterns and visualization helps a student learn even complex mathematics and apply them to new problems. The team from <strong>IIT Jodhpur</strong> (faculty members &amp; alumni) who conceived and developed this Math Lab are convinced that this lab provides a platform for teachers to teach the theoretical and abstract concepts of mathematics through experiments and visualizations — accompanied by study material for reflective thinking.</p>
      <p>Almost <strong>50% of students are afraid of maths</strong>. Math is the highest-scoring subject in every competitive exam, but a better score can only be secured with the help of the best faculty — which is practically impossible in most cases. Keeping this in mind, EduMEasy has made equipment for the Maths Lab which helps students learn math in a better and more joyful manner.</p>
      <p>This equipment is going to make math easy, more results-oriented, and students are going to love learning up to the level of understanding math easily. Concepts and colors both matter — and this <strong>Math Lab designed &amp; developed by IITians</strong> will bring revolution to the field of Math. This Math Lab is designed to cover the <strong>entire NCERT Syllabus</strong>.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="https://edumeasy.com/book-a-free-demo/" class="cta-primary">Book a Free Demo</a>
      <a href="https://edumeasy.com/contact/" class="cta-secondary">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ff2d718","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"07f6980","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"3275176","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{font-family:inherit;color:#494851;background:#fff}
  .mlw{margin:0 auto;padding:0px 16px}

  /* HERO */
  .hero-band{background:#34558d;border-radius:14px;padding:56px 48px 52px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:52px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .hero-band::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}
  .hero-band::after{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-80px;left:-40px;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
  .hero-pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 20px;margin-bottom:22px}
  .hero-band h1{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.2;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .hero-band h1 span{color:#a8c4e8}
  .hero-band p{font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.86);max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.85;position:relative;z-index:1}

  /* SECTION LABEL */
  .sec-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
  .sec-label-line{height:3px;width:40px;background:#34558d;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0}
  .sec-label h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#34558d;margin:0}

  .block-section{margin-bottom:52px}

  /* INTRO BOX */
  .intro-box{background:#F3F6F6;border-left:4px solid #34558d;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:28px 34px}
  .intro-box p{font-size:16px;color:#494851;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 16px}
  .intro-box p:last-child{margin:0}
  .intro-box strong{color:#34558d}

  /* NEED LIST */
  .need-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
  .need-list li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;font-size:15.5px;color:#494851;line-height:1.7}
  .need-list li::before{content:"◆";color:#34558d;font-size:10px;margin-top:4px;flex-shrink:0}

  /* BENEFIT GRID */
  .benefit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
  .b-card{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #dce8f0;border-radius:14px;padding:28px 24px;border-top:4px solid #34558d}
  .b-icon{width:50px;height:50px;background:#EBF1F8;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;color:#34558d;font-size:22px}
  .b-card h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#34558d;margin:0 0 10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px}
  .b-card p{font-size:15.5px;color:#494851;line-height:1.72;margin:0}

  /* OBJECTIVES */
  .obj-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}
  .obj-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;background:#F3F6F6;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px}
  .obj-num{width:32px;height:32px;background:#34558d;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0}
  .obj-item p{font-size:15.5px;color:#494851;line-height:1.65;margin:0}

  /* ACHIEVEMENTS */
  .ach-intro{background:#34558d;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 36px;margin-bottom:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .ach-stat{text-align:center;flex-shrink:0}
  .ach-stat .num{font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1}
  .ach-stat .lbl{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);margin-top:5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px}
  .ach-divider{width:1px;height:64px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25)}
  .ach-intro p{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.78;margin:0;flex:1;min-width:200px}
  .ach-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
  .ach-item{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #dce8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
  .ach-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#34558d;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:5px}
  .ach-item p{font-size:14px;color:#494851;line-height:1.68;margin:0}
  .ach-item strong{color:#2a4472}

  /* MILESTONES */
  .milestones{background:#F3F6F6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 34px;margin-top:18px}
  .milestones h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#34558d;margin:0 0 18px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.6px}
  .mile-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0}
  .mile-list li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #dde4e4;font-size:14.5px;color:#494851;line-height:1.65}
  .mile-list li:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:none}
  .mile-list li::before{content:"→";color:#34558d;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}

  /* CTA */
  .cta-band{background:#34558d;border-radius:14px;padding:46px 48px;text-align:center;margin-top:52px}
  .cta-band h2{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0 0 16px}
  .cta-band p{font-size:16.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.87);max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.85}
  .cta-sub{font-size:15px!important;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)!important;margin-top:14px!important;max-width:520px!important}

  /* ── MOBILE BREAKPOINTS ── */
  @media(max-width:768px){

    .mlw{padding:0 12px}

    /* Hero */
