    .sec-label h2{font-size:18px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="mlw">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero-band">
    <div class="hero-pill">EduMEasy — Mathematics Laboratory</div>
    <h1>Where Mathematics<br><span>Comes Alive</span></h1>
    <p>A place to experiment, explore, and discover — through games, puzzles, and hands-on activities that ignite a lifelong love for mathematics in every student.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- WHAT IS A MATH LAB -->
  <div class="block-section">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>What is a Math Lab?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-box">
      <p>A Mathematics Laboratory is a place where <strong>anybody can experiment and explore patterns and ideas</strong>. It houses a rich collection of games, puzzles, and teaching-learning materials. The Math Lab provides students the opportunity to discover the <strong>"learning by doing" method</strong> — where many activities present a problem or challenge, with the possibility of generating further challenges and problems.</p>
      <p>The activities help students to <strong>visualize, manipulate, and reason</strong>. They provide an opportunity to make conjectures and test them, and generalize observed patterns. They create a context for students to attempt to prove their conjectures. The Math Lab is a place to enjoy mathematics through <strong>informal exploration</strong> — a space where anyone can generate problems and struggle to get an answer.</p>
      <p>Often the Math Lab takes students' knowledge <strong>beyond the curriculum</strong>. It is a self-directed space with activities where students can come anytime and engage in work, continue on problems and tasks, and use teachers only when they are stuck. In this way, the role of the teacher is not to instruct how to progress — but to <strong>facilitate inquiry</strong> with the mathematics within it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- NEED & PURPOSE -->
  <div class="block-section">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>Need &amp; Purpose for Schools</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="need-list">
      <li>Provides an opportunity for students to understand and internalize basic mathematical concepts through concrete objects and situations.</li>
      <li>Enables students to verify or discover geometrical properties and facts using hands-on expositors.</li>
      <li>Helps students to build interest and confidence in learning mathematics.</li>
      <li>Exhibits the relatedness of mathematical concepts with everyday life, making the subject meaningful.</li>
      <li>Provides greater scope for individual participation and becoming autonomous, self-directed learners.</li>
      <li>Encourages students to think, discuss with peers and teachers, and assimilate concepts more effectively.</li>
      <li>Enables teachers to demonstrate and reinforce abstract ideas using models, charts, graphs, and pictures.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- HOW IT BENEFITS -->
  <div class="block-section">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>How it Benefits Students</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="benefit-grid">
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">🔬</div>
        <h3>Hands-On Discovery</h3>
        <p>Concrete objects and real situations help students deeply internalize abstract mathematical concepts through direct experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">📐</div>
        <h3>Geometry &amp; Proofs</h3>
        <p>Students verify and discover geometrical properties through direct, physical exploration — making abstract proofs tangible.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">💡</div>
        <h3>Confidence Building</h3>
        <p>A safe, exploratory environment grows genuine interest and lasting confidence in the subject for every learner.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">🌍</div>
        <h3>Real-World Connect</h3>
        <p>Activities reveal how mathematics is woven into everyday life — making the subject relevant, purposeful, and engaging.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Collaborative Thinking</h3>
        <p>Students discuss and build ideas together with peers and teachers, assimilating concepts far more effectively than solo study.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="b-card">
        <div class="b-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>Autonomous Learners</h3>
        <p>Greater individual participation helps students become independent, self-driven thinkers who take ownership of their learning.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- OBJECTIVES -->
  <div class="block-section">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>Objectives of the Mathematics Laboratory</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="obj-grid">
      <div class="obj-item"><div class="obj-num">01</div><p>Provide readily accessible rich manipulative materials to emphasize <strong>learning by doing</strong>.</p></div>
      <div class="obj-item"><div class="obj-num">02</div><p>Develop an <strong>attitude of inquiry</strong> and curiosity in every student.</p></div>
      <div class="obj-item"><div class="obj-num">03</div><p>Remove the weaknesses of <strong>present-day mathematics education</strong>.</p></div>
      <div class="obj-item"><div class="obj-num">04</div><p>Develop much-needed <strong>confidence in students</strong> and a positive relationship with maths.</p></div>
      <div class="obj-item"><div class="obj-num">05</div><p>Generate genuine <strong>interest and enthusiasm</strong> for the subject.</p></div>
      <div class="obj-item"><div class="obj-num">06</div><p>Make students <strong>divergent thinkers</strong> who look for patterns and ask bold questions.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ACHIEVEMENTS -->
  <div class="block-section">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <div class="sec-label-line"></div>
      <h2>Our Achievements &amp; Recognition</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ach-intro">
      <div class="ach-stat"><div class="num">120+</div><div class="lbl">Govt. Schools</div></div>
      <div class="ach-divider"></div>
      <div class="ach-stat"><div class="num">₹65L+</div><div class="lbl">Grants Secured</div></div>
      <div class="ach-divider"></div>
      <div class="ach-stat"><div class="num">Top 75</div><div class="lbl">Tech for Impact</div></div>
      <div class="ach-divider"></div>
      <p>Recognized by IITs, IIM Ahmedabad, the Government of Rajasthan, and leading CSR organizations for innovation and impact in experiential mathematics education.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ach-grid">
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Received <strong>₹50 Lakhs funding</strong> from iHub Drishti Foundation, IIT Jodhpur to scale curriculum-aligned Math Lab solutions nationwide.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Secured a <strong>₹15 Lakhs Grant</strong> from Kotak BizLabs under the prestigious IIMA Ventures program, recognizing innovative approach in EdTech.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Successfully established Math Labs in <strong>120 government schools across Rajsamand</strong> in collaboration with the Government of Rajasthan.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Signed an <strong>MoU with the Rajasthan School Education Department</strong> for pilot implementation of Math Labs in government schools.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Selected among the <strong>Top 75 Technologies for Social Impact in India</strong> by IIT Delhi (Unnat Bharat Abhiyan).</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Awarded <strong>2nd Rank in Tech4Seva</strong> under Aatma Nirbhar Bharat at IIT Jodhpur.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Secured <strong>grant support from IIM Ahmedabad</strong> in recognition of innovation and impact in experiential mathematics learning.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Awarded <strong>grant support by the Government of Rajasthan</strong> for contributing to foundational learning and NEP 2020 implementation.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>MoU signed between <strong>RScSE (Dept. of School Education) and EduMEasy</strong> on 23rd August 2022 for pilot in 11 schools of Jodhpur.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Collaborated with <strong>Eklava Foundation, Indeed Foundation, and Saura Urja</strong> on CSR-driven projects to expand quality math education.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Collaborated with <strong>Surya Urja and JSW</strong>, installing Math Labs in Phalodi, Nagaur, and Nagpur's tribal area schools with the Maharashtra government.</p></div>
      <div class="ach-item"><div class="ach-dot"></div><p>Published <strong>"Math Lab: Learning Math by Doing Math"</strong> in the research journal IIT Jodhpur TechScape.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="milestones">
      <h3>Key Milestones &amp; Participations</h3>
      <ul class="mile-list">
        <li>Registered with i-Start and incubated by IIT Jodhpur.</li>
        <li>EduMEasy Maths Lab selected for the best snippets of IIT Jodhpur.</li>
        <li>Presented Math Lab equipment to Hon. Shri Ashok Gehlot, CM of Rajasthan and Hon. Dr. B.D. Kalla, Education Minister, Rajasthan.</li>
        <li>Participated in Padharo IIT 2022 and 2023 at IIT Jodhpur.</li>
        <li>Participated in the IIS University 8th Rajasthan Science Congress Summit, October 2021.</li>
        <li>Presented Math Lab at Chenpura School with Indeed NGO and RSS Adarsh Vidhya Mandir Group.</li>
        <li>Installed Math Lab at Shantikunj Haridwar, inaugurated by Dr. Chinmay Pandya.</li>
        <li>Installed Math Lab and kits at Kendriya Vidyalaya IIT Jodhpur.</li>
        <li>Represented EduMEasy at DIDAC India.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cta-band">
    <h2>Partner With Us</h2>
    <p>We look forward to working with esteemed institutions and supporting efforts in maximizing the field of education. We are confident we can meet the challenges ahead and stand ready to deliver effective, world-changing innovation in mathematics education.</p>
    <p class="cta-sub">If you have any questions or require assistance, we're here to support all your school Math Lab needs.</p>
  </div>

